      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed. I want to have this patch available in case it is determined to be the correct solution. From my understanding of the issue the hard resets are unexpected since by the point they occur the AP is already up, it makes sense to me to then clear these since they were never handled but the system has been rebooted so they probably are stale.",
